Sun Jul 12 13:54:19 UTC 2026 - Martin Pluskal <mpluskal@suse.com>

- Initial package python-compressed-tensors 0.17.0
  * Library extending the safetensors format to store and manage
    compressed (quantized and sparse) tensor data for neural
    network models
